      en: ["The range serves as the boundary between Yukon and Northwest Territories.", "Mount Sir James MacBrien is the highest peak at 2,762 meters.", "The mountains stretch for a total length of 950 kilometers.", "There are no permanent communities located within the mountain range.", "The area contains some of the world's largest deposits of tungsten.", "The southern part of the range is home to Nahanni National Park Reserve."],
      es: ["Parte de las cordilleras canadienses", "Se encuentran en los Territorios del Noroeste y el Yukón", "Área de naturaleza salvaje y virgen", "Altas precipitaciones en las zonas de las cumbres", "Región de alta montaña poco desarrollada", "Hábitat importante para las ovejas de las rocas"],
