      en: ["Mount Jacques-Cartier is the highest peak at 1,268 meters.", "The mountains were formed approximately 450 million years ago.", "The range hosts the only caribou herd found south of the St. Lawrence River.", "Parc national de la Gaspésie was established in 1937.", "The name 'Chic-Choc' comes from the Mi'kmaq word meaning 'impassable barrier.'", "Snow remains on the high plateaus frequently until late July."],
      es: ["Punto más alto: Monte Jacques-Cartier (1.270 m).", "Parte de los Apalaches.", "Presencia de tundra alpina.", "Parque Nacional de la Gaspésie (1981).", "Población de caribúes.", "Nombre: Mi'kmaq para 'grandes montañas'."],
